WEBVTT

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.600
Th-This can't be happening!

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.600
Even Groribas, our best warrior was defeated?!

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.820
Just what kind of creature is he ?
How he got on the ship anyway?

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.030
Damn it!

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:52.950
Melzargard was supposed
to be guarding the ship!

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:58.120
Now he and I are
the only elite fighters left!

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.450
I bet he's just mucking about...

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.120
I need him now!

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:03.920
Curse the bastard!

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.960
Geryuganshoop,
what is the problem?

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:09.760
Lord Boros!
I-I'm terribly sorry.

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:13.260
I've allowed one of the natives
to infiltrate the ship.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.840
In the mere four minutes
since coming aboard,

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.930
he has damaged 23%
of the ship.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.060
It seems he is alone,

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.810
but he has managed
to instantly kill

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.060
every warrior sent to
intercept him.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.600
Do not panic.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.730
As long as the power sphere
is safe,

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.780
the ship will not go down.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:36.360
The damage so far is limited to
the crew's living quarters.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.660
But minnows won't be enough.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.490
Geryuganshoop...

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:45.210
you, Groribas and Melzargard,
my top lieutenants,

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.290
will go eliminate this intruder.

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:51.090
Groribas has fallen, sir...

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:53.300
What?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.380
Let me get Melzargard back here!

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:01.510
He and I together will wipe out
the intruder without fail!

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:14.810
THE DOMINATOR OF THE UNIVERSE

00:03:54.170 --> 00:04:03.180
MYSTERY CRAFT IN SKIES ABOVE CITY A

00:03:54.560 --> 00:04:00.020
We have more information on
the enormous flying object

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:02.840
that suddenly appeared
in the skies over City A.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.180
I'm here at the scene.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:10.100
As you can see, all the main roads
leading to City A have been closed,

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.230
and officials are on high alert.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.730
According to survivors,

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.610
City A has been almost
entirely demolished.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.280
EMPLOYMENT APPLICATION

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.280
NAME: HAMMERHEAD

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:32.790
MYSTERY CRAFT IN SKIES ABOVE CITY A

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:32.410
This image of the giant flying object
was captured with a telephoto lens.

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.630
What are your thoughts?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.710
Most likely, this is the act of
an alien or extraterrestrial being.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.970
Or perhaps it's an
unidentified life-form

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:44.640
that has a highly advanced
civilization unbeknownst to us.

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:48.560
Of course, other possibilities exist as well.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.060
I see.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.730
Also, there have been
eyewitness accounts of

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.560
very powerful life-forms

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.820
descending to the ground
from the spacecraft.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:04.360
Several Class S heroes are presently
at the location tackling the issue.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.670
He pummeled that thing with
nothing but his bare fists.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.340
That's a Class S for you.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:26.930
But even so...

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.520
It's still no good!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.690
It possesses incredible regenerative powers.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:38.480
And don't let it hit any part of you.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.570
A single blow instantly tore my arm off.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.200
Dodge its attacks at all costs!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.870
If I may cut in...

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:03.800
Shall we use a bombardment
to finish them off?

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.170
That is good.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.130
Contact the ship.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.600
I will go.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.560
Get back here!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.730
You scum!

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:18.650
Don't you underestimate me, bastart!

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:22.480
I hope you like mincemeat, freak!

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.900
Melzargard! What are you doing?!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:26.860
I'm in battle.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.110
We have an intruder!

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.990
Ridiculous.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:33.950
It's true. Finish them off
and get up here quickly!

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.170
This one's locked too...

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.590
Hey, open up! You've got a visitor!

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.680
Oops... I broke it.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:00.770
I've decided.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.860
I'm going to rip your limbs off,

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.650
then keep you as the ship mascot.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.110
That is good.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.820
Pulled yourself together again, eh?

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.870
I'm gonna keep you
for batting practice!

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:39.480
Everyone! It seems that direct physical attacks

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.650
have no effect on him!

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:43.060
Let's withdraw for now...

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:46.730
and think of a way to destroy it,
like heat or something!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:51.030
Smashing is all I can do! Forget it!

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.820
This is all I know, too.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.950
Can't teach an old dog new tricks.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.790
Me, too. Sorry, sweet Iairon!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.920
Iai, don't you have faith in me?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.050
There's nothing I can't cut down.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:09.800
It's pointless...

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:14.800
These guys aren't the type to listen.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:20.440
Melzargard!

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.900
Look, I really need you on the ship.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:24.940
Getting rid of the intruder takes priority.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:29.940
I'd love to, but I'm busy.
These creatures are persistent.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.490
What the hell?

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:35.700
The life forms down there
are proving tough to handle too?

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.870
Nothing tough about them.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.910
What's with the ship?
Is it going down?

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:43.880
It's not going down,

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:46.920
but more than half
the crew have been killed.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.050
What the hell?!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:54.470
Listen. Begin cleansing my location

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.430
with a bombardment from the ship!

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.430
I've got my hands full right now.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:02.480
Besides, artillery bombardment is
the job of the lower ranks.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:05.850
Well, I'm in a situation where
I can't return to the ship.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.400
All right.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.070
I'll notify the artillery crews.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:12.820
Don't get caught up in
the barrage and die.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.200
Hey, wait!

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:20.870
You should come down here
and help me.

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:22.540
That'd be much faster.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.830
Oi! Geryuganshoop!

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:30.250
Damn him. How tough is this intruder?

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:35.680
How about another one?!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.930
More futile attacks.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:43.230
Although you are exhausting
yourself. That is good.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.480
The hell is this?

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:55.240
A marble? Why've you got this?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.740
Give it back!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:09:59.490
Sure thing.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:05.660
Damn!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.330
That's nasty, you nasty bastard!
You dead?

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:14.090
Hey, this guy's got marble-
looking things inside him.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.180
That's where you hurt him!

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.720
Oh!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.970
Nice work.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:26.310
So I just have to keep slicing
until I hit a vital marble!

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:31.770
Impossible!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.990
I've been growing that head
for a hundred years!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.900
It died in a dump like this?

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:41.870
But you scum are all dead
when the shells hit.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.830
They're on their way!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.890
Attention, intruder!

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:55.960
Stop your destructive acts
and leave this instant.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.130
Attention, intruder!

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:58.890
Leave immediately.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:03.060
Otherwise, we will unleash
all our forces against you!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.350
What's that?

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:07.770
I hear a voice right inside my head.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.190
Take one more step...

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.020
...and you're dead!

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.480
Even if I wanted to get out,

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.820
I can't. I've lost my way!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.320
Really? You'll leave?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.120
All right, I will guide you.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.950
Take a right, then go
up the stairs there.

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:26.790
A right?

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.660
Exactly, a right.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:32.880
I guess I'll go left!

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.880
No, wait! Not that way!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.720
W-W-Wait...
Hang on! You can't...!

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.880
All right, that was my fault!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:44.350
I'll come to you.
Please stay right there.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.100
Ahhh! Noooo!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:54.060
Now this place looks like
a control room or something.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:55.610
You...

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.110
An octopus?

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:06.990
You dare go around
busting up our ship?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.250
Hey! The debris is all flying at me!

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:18.420
Now Geryuganshoop, the supreme
telekinetic power in the universe,

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:20.340
will grind you into blood sausage.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.700
Just about there.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.430
Lord Geryuganshoop,
preparations for the bombardment

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.790
are nearly complete.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.540
Shall I proceed?

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:02.220
Maybe he went to the bathroom...

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.930
Hey, Lord Geryuganshoop!

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:11.430
Telekinetic power...like a psychic?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.810
You leave me no choice.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.820
Super Telekinetic Gravitational Wave!

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.990
Die, Earthling!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.910
My unparalleled telekinetic powers allow me

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:32.000
to manipulate even the forces of gravity!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:35.710
Have you any idea
what a black hole is, you ape?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.880
Inside one, the gravitational
effects are so strong

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.800
even light itself cannot escape!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.590
Wait...?

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.020
Now what is he doing?

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.270
Take this!
Telekinetic Shower of Rubble!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.660
I got him!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.210
What a waste of psychic powers.

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.540
I mean, all you're doing
is tossing pebbles around.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.000
Anyone can do that.

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.380
How...could...

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.800
I...Geryuganshoop...

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.010
be...

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.850
Excuse me—

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:34.980
Can I ask...

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.440
...where your boss is?

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.320
This looks bad.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.870
Is that confirmed?

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:55.500
Yes, Child Emperor said that
the energy level in

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.750
the spaceship is rapidly rising.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.080
Yes, but the civilians—

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.840
Recall the search and
rescue teams for now.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.470
Have everyone take cover.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:08.510
You'll be taking fire soon!

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:21.900
Hop on!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:27.780
There we go.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.820
Geryuganshoop still hasn't
gotten back to me...

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:31.780
but whatever.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:33.620
Let's see...

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.790
I believe the order was
to concentrate fire

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:40.750
around the enemies on
the surface near Melzargard.

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.920
Now only two more heads to go!

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.930
I'll bust 'em wide open!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.550
Is it time?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.930
Ship, bombardment, coming...

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:57.890
There they are.

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.390
All right...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.150
click!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:06.980
It's over.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.860
Evasion, impossible.
Instant death.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.750
Huh... What happened?

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:25.920
What on earth?

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.420
They stopped.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.800
All of you would be dead without me.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.930
Can't you even finish one small fry?

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:36.970
Maybe try starting over from Class C.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.900
You can have...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.520
your shells back.

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.280
Th-This is...

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:06.790
I wanna go home.

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:14.010
I didn't expect you to be here.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.640
Thank you, Mumen Rider.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:19.890
Which areas are likely
to have survivors?

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.430
There must be more out there.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.150
But you...

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:25.940
I'll go rescue them right now.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.900
We want to know, too.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:31.900
Yeah, can't let him hog the limelight.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.950
Stinger, Lightning Max...

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.910
Mind if we borrow this?

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.910
You guys...

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.840
Nice catch.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.360
Found it...

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.480
Smush.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.070
One left!

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:17.780
Silverfang!

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:21.450
A...direct hit.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:29.460
Weak, weak!

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:32.090
You are all so very weak.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:33.920
Dead after a single hit!

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:37.220
A change of tactics was all I needed.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:41.140
If I forget defense and focus on attack,

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.100
this will all be over quickly.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.930
And you're next!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:51.230
I will spring past that sword and
squeeze your skull 'til it pops.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.820
If you think so? Then be my guest.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.670
So he's here.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:39.030
This planet's finest warrior...

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:41.870
I can sense no limit to his energy.

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:46.120
You the boss of these invaders?

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.500
Wonderful!

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:53.170
Before we fight, let us exchange names.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:20:00.380
I lead the pirate band known as Dark Matter,

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.470
and dominator of the universe,
 Boros.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.770
I'm a hero for fu—I mean,

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.350
a professional hero.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.020
My name's Saitama.

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:11.770
Saitama...

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.360
Look, I don't know what
the Denominator of the Universe

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.030
wants with Earth...

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.240
...but you sure trashed City A.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.410
What I want with Earth?

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.040
There exists a prophecy.

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.540
Prophecy? You mean...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:34.540
Once, I traveled the universe,
ravaging everything in sight.

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:38.420
But I was too strong.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:42.770
Eventually, there were none left
who could face me.

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:47.060
I came to know the torment of utter,
all-encompassing boredom.

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:51.310
Then one day, a seer told me...

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.900
On a faraway planet,

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:55.940
a being exists who is my match,

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.570
one who could rekindle
my passion for battle.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.570
That was nearly twenty years ago.

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:05.700
Do you have any idea about the
distance I had to travel to get here?

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:10.330
My men thought the prophecy
was a ruse,

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.040
made up to lure me away...

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.710
But now I am certain.

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:19.380
Come. Give stimulation
to my existence.

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:21.590
That is why I am here!

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.010
Are you stupid?

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:31.180
You can't just go around
attacking other planets

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.850
just to liven up your boring life.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.890
Even telemarketers wouldn't think that.

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:56.580
This set of armor, used to seal
 my immeasurable, irresistible power...

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:58.420
...has now been broken.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:00.170
OK.

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:27.660
Here I come!